# Bone Shards, whose additional cost is a sacrifice and whose effect has a target. Alice (`human…`,
# seat 0) holds Bone Shards and nothing else, so its cost can only be the sacrifice (no card is left to
# discard). One Swamp pays its {B}. Her Grizzly Bears is the creature to sacrifice; bob's Hill Giant is
# the target. Forge asks the target first and the sacrifice after it (rule 601.2c before 601.2h). The
# Bears are the only legal sacrifice, so the server takes them for her (`bo-bone-shards-two` has two).
